From 8aea276aa9b36264f5f970249a21a9606a5cc3f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 06:24:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Overhaul v2: brand voice, vibrant colors, unified booking,
 newsletter
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Content & voice
- Rewrite all site copy in a lifestyle/community tone ("Dahab isn't a
  trip, it's a mood") — Adham's brief: brand-as-community, not tour agency
- Update TRUST_STATS to the 4 promises: 10 Years Experience,
  High Quality Tour Operation, Hosted Like a Friend,
  Giving Back to Local Communities

Design system
- Replace muted cream/beige "sand" palette with clean whites +
  light blue tints so the brand blue+orange actually pops
- Vibrant sea (#1AA6E8) + sun (#F79333) tuned to the logo's own colors
- Softer symmetric rounded corners (1.5rem) instead of asymmetric pin
- Logo: strip white background from public/logo.png (now transparent PNG),
  regenerate favicon from the transparent version
- Arabic font: Noto Kufi Arabic → Tajawal (modern, warm, humanist —
  used by Careem/Anghami/Talabat) — much better in body copy and headings

Booking flow
- Remove standalone /transfers page + TransferBookingClient
- Unify all bookings into a single BookingForm with three modes:
  Full package / Stay only / Transfer only
- Package mode: NO date pickers — fixed Sun/Thu departure and Mon/Fri
  return auto-computed from duration (4 or 5 days), shown as an info card
- Transfer only mode supports bus (fixed days) or Hiace (any day),
  round-trip / one-way to/from Dahab
- Remove /transfers from nav

Locale
- Enable next-intl auto-detection from Accept-Language (still keeps the
  manual toggle in the header)

Newsletter
- New newsletter_subscribers table (migration_v4.sql) with RLS
- New /api/newsletter endpoint with per-IP rate limit and upsert-by-email
- New NewsletterSignup component rendered above the footer on every page

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
